scenario: SND-EAR-05
title: Web page sound reaches the speakers
area: Sound
rows: F-SND-06
machines: macbookpro, mac mini, lenovo, any
needs: person
prereq: Internet connection. The Browser tile opens.
step: Open the Browser tile and go to a page that plays a short sound or video (a public video site).
expect: The page loads and shows its player.
clause: web
step: Press play on the page's video.
expect: You hear the page's sound through the chosen output and the picture and sound stay together.
clause: sound
step: Change the volume with the keys while the page plays.
expect: The page's loudness follows the keys.
clause: volume
step: Leave the Browser tile (press Esc) while the video plays.
expect: The sound stops or goes on as the Browser tile says in its hint; it never keeps playing with nothing on screen to stop it.
clause: leave
